[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2429603\">7040L28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429602\">7040L22</a></p><p>1. Release the cover.</p><p>2. Undo the bolts.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045248.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Unscrew the nuts.</p><p>2. Move the trim (2a) and disconnect the electrical connection (2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Cigar lighter/current socket</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428764\">P50</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Keep the tunnel cover.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045249.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p><a href=\"#/2429699\">7065C72</a>\n                                           (if necessary)</p>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the cover is undamaged.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429699\">7065C72</a>\n                                           (if\nnecessary)</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Position the trim and tighten the nuts.</p><p>Tighten the bolts and fit the cover.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429602\">7040L22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429603\">7040L28</a></p>"]]